{"id":"66b7b29c36e8cacb","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-universal-set.md","title":"ZFC Universal Set","display":"df-zfc-universal-set — ZFC Universal Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-universal-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-universal-set","58-df-zfc-descriptive3-universal-set"],"display":"df-zfc-universal-set — ZFC Universal Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-universal-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-universal-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-universal-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-universal-set — ZFC Universal Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c4da5e95c10688be\" href=\"?note=c4da5e95c10688be\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md\">../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\Gamma,D\\in V\">\\(U,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\Gamma,D\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polish}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Pointclass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Polish}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Pointclass}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3UniversalSet}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3UniversalSet}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}universal\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UniversalSet}_S(U,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\Gamma,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Polish}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Pointclass}_S(\\Gamma,D)\n\\land X,Y,X\\times Y\\in D\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nU\\subseteq X\\times Y\n\\land U\\in\\Gamma(X\\times Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left(\n\\{y\\in Y:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in U\\}\\in\\Gamma(Y)\n\\right)\n\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Gamma(Y)\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;\n\\left(\nA=\\{y\\in Y:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in U\\}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}universal\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UniversalSet}_S(U,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\Gamma,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Polish}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Pointclass}_S(\\Gamma,D)\n\\land X,Y,X\\times Y\\in D\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nU\\subseteq X\\times Y\n\\land U\\in\\Gamma(X\\times Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left(\n\\{y\\in Y:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in U\\}\\in\\Gamma(Y)\n\\right)\n\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Gamma(Y)\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;\n\\left(\nA=\\{y\\in Y:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in U\\}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}universal\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3UniversalSet}_S\n(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\Gamma,D,U)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{UniversalSet}_S(U,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\Gamma,D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}universal\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3UniversalSet}_S\n(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\Gamma,D,U)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{UniversalSet}_S(U,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\Gamma,D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> is the explicit domain of the set-coded pointclass function. Membership of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times Y\">\\(X\\times Y\\)</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> guards every application of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-universal-set</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4da5e95c10688be","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\Gamma,D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Polish}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Pointclass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3UniversalSet}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}universal\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UniversalSet}_S(U,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\Gamma,D)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Polish}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Pointclass}_S(\\Gamma,D)\n\\land X,Y,X\\times Y\\in D\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\nU\\subseteq X\\times Y\n\\land U\\in\\Gamma(X\\times Y)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left(\n\\{y\\in Y:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in U\\}\\in\\Gamma(Y)\n\\right)\n\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Gamma(Y)\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;\n\\left(\nA=\\{y\\in Y:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in U\\}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}universal\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3UniversalSet}_S\n(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\Gamma,D,U)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{UniversalSet}_S(U,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\Gamma,D).","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"X\\times Y","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1685,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3857","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-universal-set.md|58-df-zfc-universal-set]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","c4da5e95c10688be","4b3a8629f6a6f868"]}